---
title: My work and impact
teaser: 'Evidence-led impact stories: UNDRR platform transformation (50–70% faster), EMBL Visual Framework (50+ sites), editorial efficiency, and governance improvements.'
layout: layouts/base.njk
templateEngineOverride: njk
---

<div>
  <section class="kh-content kh-u-padding__top--800 kh-u-padding__bottom--200">
    <h1 class="kh-text-heading--1">{{title}}</h1>
    <p class="kh-intro__text">
      Evidence‑backed impact across platforms & performance, design systems, and structured content for AI.
    </p>
    <p class="">
      Want the broader picture? Read my <a href="/cv/">CV</a>, get in touch via
      <a rel="me" href="mailto:khawkins98@gmail.com">email</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/allaboutken">LinkedIn</a>,
      <a href="/search/">search the site</a>, or browse the <a href="/blog">blog</a> to get more of a sense of me.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<section class="kh-content kh-content--wide">
  <section>
    {% set stories = collections.impactStories or [] %}
    {% if stories.length %}
      <div class="kh-section-head">
        <h2 class="kh-text-heading--2"><span class="kh-section-number">1.0</span>Impact record</h2>
        <span class="kh-meta">{{ stories.length }} records &middot; figures as reported</span>
      </div>
      <div class="kh-table-scroll">
      <table class="kh-table--spec">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Ref</th>
            <th scope="col">What</th>
            <th scope="col">When</th>
            <th scope="col">Who</th>
            <th scope="col">Topics</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {%- for post in stories -%}
          <tr>
            {# Stable ref from the shared filter (oldest = IS-01), not the
               display order, so the number survives new stories being added.
               The non-breaking hyphen keeps the ref on one line. #}
            <td class="kh-table__id">{{ (collections.impactStories | impactStoryRef(post.url)) | replace('-', '&#8209;') | safe }}</td>
            <td>
              <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title | replace('Impact story: ', '') }}</a>
              {% if post.data.teaser %}<small class="kh-table__note">{{ post.data.teaser | striptags }}</small>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td>{{ post.date | dateDisplay('y') }}</td>
            <td>{% if post.data.org %}{{ post.data.org }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</td>
            <td>
              {% if post.data.topics -%}
                {% for t in post.data.topics %}<span class="kh-label">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}
              {%- endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p>No impact stories yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
</section>

<br>